                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExternalTensorProduct"}
          %h4#InTermsOfProfunctors In terms of profunctors
          %p
            The Day convolution can also be expressed in terms of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/profunctors"} profunctors
